# Local secrets for `npm run dev`, which runs the site on Cloudflare's workerd
# runtime. Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in. `.dev.vars` is gitignored.
#
# In production these are Worker secrets, NOT values in wrangler.jsonc:
#   npx wrangler secret put RESEND_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
# or Workers > blinto-astro > Settings > Variables and Secrets in the dashboard.
#
# Both are read through `astro:env/server` with access 'secret', so importing
# either from client code fails the build. Neither can reach the browser.

# https://resend.com/api-keys — needs "Sending access" only.
RESEND_API_KEY=""

# https://dash.cloudflare.com > Turnstile > your widget > Settings.
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=""
